    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "The effort spans 2 to 6 months, depending on the candidate's performance, to ensure a full assignment life cycle with tangible results. Please remember that short-term internships are focused on specific goals, without the possibility of transitioning into a full-time role. No payment from the company and no fee from the candidate (we never collect any fee for any assignment) An internship can be after degree completion or during the degree study. Full-time preferred, but we can discuss if the candidate can spend at least 10 hours per week Need a request letter from the College/ University (if the degree is not yet completed) You will get an internship experience letter/ certificate on successful completion.",
